nals take appropriate steps toward better metabolic health."}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"border-t border-border/60 bg-muted/20 py-16 lg:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight","children":"Types of Diabetes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-muted-foreground","children":"Click on each type to learn more about its characteristics"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","div","Type 1 Diabetes",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary","children":"Diabetes"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Type 1 Diabetes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"An autoimmune condition where the body stops making enough insulin."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-foreground/80","children":[["$","li","Often starts in childhood or adolescence",{"className":"flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Often starts in childhood or adolescence"}]]}],["$","li","Requires lifelong insulin therapy",{"className":"flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Requires lifelong insulin therapy"}]]}],["$","li","Early detection supports better management",{"className":"flex gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Early detection support